No file picker on a console: the mobile ROM path instead

`SelectGameFromUI` opens a desktop file dialog through `portable-file-dialogs`,
which runs zenity or kdialog over pipe/fork/dup2 - none of which this platform
has, and the header does not compile for it. `../ghostship/patches/0002` and
`../ship-of-harkinian/patches/0006` make the same call for the same header.

The mobile arm is the one that fits: the ROM is `baserom.us.rev1.z64` beside
the program. Whichever supported version it is, the checksum table below it
decides; only the name is fixed.

